  "prompt": "For every competitor price check of products 1 to 10 (product_id from 1 to 10, both included) observed from 1 January to 30 June 2025 (observed_ts holds UTC time; both days included, in UTC), show the average price of that check and the 2 checks before it of the same product by the same competitor, rounded to 2 decimals. Checks follow each other by observed_ts. No product has two checks by the same competitor at the same moment. Only checks in that period count, so the first checks of a product and competitor have fewer than 3 to average: show how many checks each average covers in checks_in_window. Return six columns, in this order: product_id, competitor, observed_ts, price_eur, avg_price_3c and checks_in_window. Return one row for each such price check. Any row order is fine.",
